            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a method comprising receiving (500) a radio frame configuration selected for a cell by a network element (110) and applying (306) the received radio frame configuration. The radio frame configuration comprises a flexible special sub-frame (408, 418) dynamically configurable by the network element (110) as either a flexible special downlink sub-frame (408) or as a flexible special uplink sub-frame (418). The method further comprises, scanning for a control channel of a downlink part of the flexible special sub-frame to determine a link direction of the flexible special sub-frame. The downlink part comprises an information element indicating the link direction for the flexible special sub-frame. The method comprises scanning for another information element indicating whether or not a terminal device (120) has resources allocated to the flexible special sub-frame, and processing the flexible special sub-frame according to the other information element.</p>
            </abstract>
